    story: David Slycrusher was born in a salt flat camp, where water, shade, and distance shaped every decision. As a child, David Slycrusher lived through a surgery lamp duty, learning pain, recovery, herbs, and the fragile mechanics of bodies. As a young adult, David Slycrusher worked through a monster bestiary work, copying maps, wounds, and combat notes until patterns became weapons. They enter the dojo to test theory against pain.
